    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Following a connection",
     "texto": [
      "On a transport table, first find the departure stop and the destination. **Avgang** is departure and **ankomst** arrival. Compare the times to work out the duration and look for change symbols; **direkte** means there is no change.",
      "Times in Norwegian timetables use the 24-hour format: **14.35**. If the change is brief, compare the arrival time of the first service with the departure of the next one; don't assume a delayed service will wait."
     ],
